  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Aotearoa New Zealand International Development Studies Network (DevNet) consolidated support</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This Activity&#xa0;consolidates MFAT&apos;s ongoing support to Aotearoa New Zealand International Development Studies Network (DevNet) for the DevNet Conference, the NZ Postgraduate Development Research Awards, and support to new and emerging Pacific researchers. This Activity aims to promote research and learning for development policy and practice in Aotearoa New Zealand and the Pacific, consistent with the expected outcomes of DevNet, and New Zealand&#x2019;s development cooperation focus.</narrative>
  </description>
